        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Traits</strong> Paradise-Touched, mental</p><hr /><p>When you speak to a creature telepathically, you may deliver the words in the voice of anyone that creature has heard speak, living or dead. The recipient is never deceived — they know the voice is coming from you — and this grants no benefit to Impersonate or to any attempt to pass as someone else. It does grant a +1 circumstance bonus to Deception, Diplomacy, and Intimidation checks you make against that creature through your telepathy, because the voice works on them whether or not they believe it.</p>"
        },
